{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WejpyiIIEe1794919748.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>台灣的基隆監獄因刑期計錯數，導致有囚犯提早出獄。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TW.PRISON-2000-1_CLEAN_20261117_201436.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vs1KlmAo0m1794919763.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>台灣傳媒日前報道指，基隆監獄在計算減刑分數時出錯，五名刑期未滿的在囚人士，分別提早幾日至十多日獲釋。基隆監獄證實有兩人仍在服刑，已修正資料，一人已返回監獄服刑，其餘兩人，獄方已通知他們，周三前往地檢署報到。當局稱會依規定追究相關人員的責任。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T13:14:36.294020+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:18:12.013223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T13:07:43.442948+00:00","content_hash":"55dcf296eb4c6109f5969cedc60d9f51732a8e0c4a7c479dd3c33b33cc664414","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T13:14:36.294020+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}